+**Targeting a namespace (`namespace`):**
+
+```json
+{
+  "keyPrefix": "/projects/myapp/",
+  "namespace": "my-project"
+}
+```
+
+Omitting `namespace` queries the ACTIVE namespace instead of `default` — the response always echoes the namespace actually queried.
